# E-commerce Order
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: E-commerce — a real, constrained header-detail document, same shape as
# Case 9's Journal Entry. Payment is Case 8's Payment machine, referenced, not rebuilt.
# Case 15 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
# References: ecommerce-cart.menata, ecommerce-product.menata, ecommerce-order-line.menata
#
# The individual line items belong to Order Line, a separate Object that references
# back to this one (- Order : Order, see ecommerce-order-line.menata) — no "Lines"
# field is declared here, same pattern as accounting-journal-entry.menata /
# accounting-journal-entry-line.menata.

Order

Fields

- Order Number : Text
- Customer : User
- Total Amount : Money
- Status : Pending | Paid | Fulfilled
- Placed At : Date

Constraints

- Order Number is required.
- Customer is required.
- At least one Order Line is required.

Permissions

Customer

- View

Fulfillment

- Fulfill

Views

- Order List : List
- Order Detail : Detail
